s="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2.5 4H5l2.2 10.5h10.3L19.6 7H6"/><circle cx="9" cy="19" r="1.6"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="19" r="1.6"/></svg></span><span><strong>Groceries</strong><span class="t">About 6 minutes</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 3h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zM12 7.5v9M7.5 12h9"/></svg></span><span><strong>Hospital</strong><span class="t">About 10 minutes</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 16v-4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10.5l2 5M14.5 11l4-7H21M8.5 17.5h4M2 21.5h20"/><circle cx="6.5" cy="17.5" r="2"/><circle cx="14.5" cy="17.5" r="2"/></svg></span><span><strong>Lawn care</strong><span class="t">Mowed for you</span></span></li></ul></div><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated October 27, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Del Webb North Myrtle Beach is a newer 55+ neighborhood of mostly one-story houses on short streets around ponds.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Del Webb North Myrtle Beach has about 400 homes built so far, and its builder is still selling new ones. At least one person in each household must be 55 or older.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Owners share a clubhouse with an indoor lap pool, an outdoor pool and a fitness center. There are also courts for pickleball and bocce, and walking trails.</p><div style="margin-top:1.4rem"><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Talk to an agent</a></div><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:2rem;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#what-are-the-homes-like-in-del-webb-north-myrtle-beach" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">The homes</a></li><li><a href="#what-is-there-to-do-in-del-webb-north-myrtle-beach" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Things to do</a></li><li><a href="#where-is-del-webb-north-myrtle-beach" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Where it is</a></li><li><a href="#what-is-north-myrtle-beach-like" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">The town</a></li><li><a href="#what-does-a-home-in-del-webb-north-myrtle-beach-cost" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Costs</a></li>