r</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Myrtle Trace has about 500 homes, and at least one person in each home must be 55 or older. The homeowners association (HOA) fee is $95 a month.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Conway Medical Center and a Walmart Supercenter are each about 3 minutes away by car. Owners share a clubhouse, a pool and ponds for fishing. The neighborhood calendar lists about 70 events and club meetings a month.</p><div style="margin-top:1.4rem"><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Talk to an agent</a></div><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:2rem;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#what-is-close-to-myrtle-trace" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What is close</a></li><li><a href="#what-is-a-month-like-in-myrtle-trace" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">A normal month</a></li><li><a href="#what-are-the-homes-like-in-myrtle-trace" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">The homes</a></li><li><a href="#what-is-conway-like" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Conway</a></li><li><a href="#what-does-it-cost-to-live-in-myrtle-trace" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Costs</a></li><li><a href="#who-can-live-in-myrtle-trace" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--n