+## What are Annie Andrews' policies on housing and taxes?
+Andrews proposes nine things that touch homes or what owners pay, from her affordability plan and platform . Each is a proposal. A federal law needs a House majority, the Senate and the president.
+In the Senate, most bills need 60 votes to end debate. A budget bill under the reconciliation process passes with a simple majority.
