+- Gas. Let the governor pause the state gas tax for up to 120 days, as reported.
+
+- Schools. Fully fund public schools and expand school choice.
+
+- Health. Rural clinics and telemedicine.
+
+- Benefits. Deny state benefits to people here illegally.
+
+- State agencies. Independent performance audits, led by the lieutenant governor.
+
+- Utilities. Build the energy grid and add competition, as reported.
