ay by car.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Houses with yards usually sold for about $350,000 in the past year.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Tell us your price range. We will send the homes for sale in The Farm that fit.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Send me the homes for sale</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="homes-now"><div class="wrap"><style>main#main .hx-strip:empty{display:none}main#main .hx-strip:not(:empty)+.hx-fallback{display:none}</style><div class="hx-strip" data-place="the-farm" data-name="The Farm"></div><style>main#main .detail-hero .detail-sub{display:none}</style></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="what-makes-the-farm-at-carolina-forest-different"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="What makes it different">What makes The Farm at Carolina Forest different?</h2><style>.c3ph-f{position:relative;margin:0;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ivory-2)}.c3ph-f img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:cover}.c3ph-cr{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;max-width:100%;padding:1.6rem .6rem .35rem 2.6rem;font:400 .625rem/1.3 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.01em;color:#fff;text-align:right;background:radial-gradient(farthest-side at 100% 100%,rgba(28,32,40,.72),rgba(28,32,40,.4) 55%,rgba(28,32,40,0));white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;pointer-events:none}.c3ph-cr a{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);text-underline-offset:2px;pointer-events:auto;padding:10px 0 6px}.c3ph-hero{margin:1.6rem 0 2rem}.c3ph-hero .c3ph-f{border-radius:8px}.c3ph-hero i